    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heatchain is a fast and intense arcade game, where concentration and reactivity are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to find the next glyph as quickly as possible among those present on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain the correct glyphs, collect the bonuses, and form the longest possible chain to reach the maximum score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its short games, Heatchain offers a thrilling arcade experience, where every second counts to maximize your score and achieve the perfect chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 3 minutes to achieve the highest possible score. Don't let yourself be distracted by the bonuses or the time pressure. Click quickly, avoid mistakes, and keep your chain intact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Principles of the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the glyphs: Each game begins with a target glyph in the center of the interface. The player must find it on the board. Two following glyphs are also displayed to allow you to anticipate your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain Fast: The faster you find glyphs, the higher your score multiplier will be, with a maximum multiplier of 15. Each glyph found is worth 10 points, multiplied by your current multiplier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Pace: Chain 20 glyphs in a row to trigger RUSH mode, where you will have a few seconds to maximize your score with no board movement and a multiplier boosted to 20.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUSH Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This special mode allows you to click on as many glyphs as possible for a limited period of time with a multiplier at maximum. The board will no longer move, and it is up to you to exploit this opportunity to boost your score before the mode ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521350/extras/28b41e75e38fb7b8f58303505646de00.poster.avif?t=1745406202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521350/extras/28b41e75e38fb7b8f58303505646de00.webm?t=1745406202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521350/extras/28b41e75e38fb7b8f58303505646de00.mp4?t=1745406202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heatchain is a fast and intense arcade game, where concentration and reactivity are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to find the next glyph as quickly as possible among those present on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain the correct glyphs, collect the bonuses, and form the longest possible chain to reach the maximum score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its short games, Heatchain offers a thrilling arcade experience, where every second counts to maximize your score and achieve the perfect chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 3 minutes to achieve the highest possible score. Don't let yourself be distracted by the bonuses or the time pressure. Click quickly, avoid mistakes, and keep your chain intact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Principles of the game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the glyphs: Each game begins with a target glyph in the center of the interface. The player must find it on the board. Two following glyphs are also displayed to allow you to anticipate your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain Fast: The faster you find glyphs, the higher your score multiplier will be, with a maximum multiplier of 15. Each glyph found is worth 10 points, multiplied by your current multiplier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Pace: Chain 20 glyphs in a row to trigger RUSH mode, where you will have a few seconds to maximize your score with no board movement and a multiplier boosted to 20.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUSH Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This special mode allows you to click on as many glyphs as possible for a limited period of time with a multiplier at maximum. The board will no longer move, and it is up to you to exploit this opportunity to boost your score before the mode ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521350/extras/28b41e75e38fb7b8f58303505646de00.poster.avif?t=1745406202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521350/extras/28b41e75e38fb7b8f58303505646de00.webm?t=1745406202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521350/extras/28b41e75e38fb7b8f58303505646de00.mp4?t=1745406202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
